        "cooked": "<p>Mini Pack 2 Variant Unlocks:</p><p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/variant-unlock-eternal-haka-7987\">Eternal Haka</a></p><p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/variant-unlock-scholar-of-the-infinite-7986\">Scholar of the Infinite</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Infernal Relics Variant Unlocks:</p><p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/variant-unlock-agent-of-gloom-spite-7519\">Agent of Gloom Spite - UNLOCKED</a></p><p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/variant-unlock-dark-visionary-unlocked-7515\">Dark Visonary&nbsp;- UNLOCKED</a></p><p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/variant-unlock-dark-watch-nightmist-7514\">Dark Watch NightMist - UNLOCKED</a></p><p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/variant-unlock-ra-horus-of-two-horizons-7517\">Ra: Horus of Two Horizons - UNLOCKED</a></p><p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/variant-unlock-redeemer-fanatic-7516\">Redeemer FanatiC - UNLOCKED</a></p><p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/variant-unlock-skinwalker-gloomweaver-7518\">Skinwalker GloomWeaver - UNLOCKED 1 of 2</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Previous Discussions (the unlocks are currently known):</p><p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/sotm-the-video-game-promo-unlock-spoilers-and-theories-spoilers-6242\">Core Game Variants</a></p><p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/unlocking-rook-city-variants-spoilers-7206\">Rook City Variants</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"http://sentinelsdigital.com/variants.html\">Official Unlock Instructions from Handelabra</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Information on the back stories of each of the variants can be found at the <a href=\"http://sentinelsofthemultiverse.com/multiverse\">Official SotM Website</a> and <a href=\"http://sotm.wikidot.com/\">SotM Wiki</a>. The variant information is at the bottom of the page for the specific character.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
